<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://cursorial.dev/ui" xmlns:x="https://cursorial.dev/xaml">

  <!--
    The cell-faithful palette spine (design doc §11.2/§11.8a), authored declaratively as ThemeDictionaries — the
    data twin of CursorialTheme.AddTierPalette/Populate. Each x:Key is a ThemeVariantKey (base+tier): RGB role
    tokens live at (B,Ansi256) and serve Truecolor by descent (CD8 — descent never ascends); hand-picked palette
    indices at (B,Ansi16) beat the quantizer; the (null,NoColor) tier collapses every color role to Default so no
    RGB strands (state distinction rides the caps-nocolor TextAttributes layer in BuiltIn's style channel). The
    pens are opt-in chrome; ObscuredOverlay carries alpha (#AARRGGBB). Pen lives in Cursorial.Drawing.Media, which
    is part of the default UI uri namespace, so it is authored prefix-free as <Pen> (like the brushes).
  -->
